return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:26:29+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:26:29+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Kaṣe oju-iwe kan ati kaṣe nkan Redis fun eyikeyi aaye WordPress. Nlo kaṣe olupin LiteSpeed nibiti o ba wa ati kaṣe disiki ti ara rẹ ni gbogbo ibomiran, npa ohun ti iyipada kan kan nikan rẹ, o si nfi idi rẹ mulẹ pe asopọ Redis rẹ nṣiṣẹ.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kaṣi','Page cache'=>'Àkójọ ojú-ewé','Object cache'=>'Àfipamọ́ ohun','Purging'=>'Ń fọ̀mọ́','Exclusions'=>'Àwọn ìyọkúrò','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Àwọn aṣojú AI (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'Nu gbogbo rẹ nisisiyi','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Gbogbo oju-iwe ti a kashi ni a o sọnu ti a o si tun kọ bi awọn alejo ti n de. Ṣe o fẹ lati tẹsiwaju?','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Gba awọn aṣoju AI laaye (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Pípa: àwọn irinṣẹ́ tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí àti àwọn ipa ọ̀nà REST wọn kò tíì fi orúkọ sílẹ̀ rárá.','Full-page cache'=>'Fipamọ́ oju-iwe pipe','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Lori olupin LiteSpeed kan, olupin wẹẹbu n ṣafihan awọn oju-iwe ṣaaju ki WordPress to bẹrẹ iṣẹ. Lori eyikeyi olupin miiran, afikun yii n tọju oju-iwe kọọkan gẹgẹbi faili kan ati pe o n ṣafihan rẹ ṣaaju ki WordPress to kojọpọ. Nibi ni gbogbo iyara ti fẹrẹ ti wa.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Fipamọ́ àwọn ojú-ewé fún àwọn àlejò tí kò wọlé','How long a page stays cached'=>'Bí ojú-ewé kan yóò ṣe pẹ́ tó nínú àkójọ ìpamọ́','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá. Ọ̀sẹ̀ kan dára fún ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù; ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù ìròyìn tí ń tẹ̀wé jáde ní gbogbo wákàtí ń fẹ́ èyí tí ó kéré púpọ̀ sí i.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Bí àwòkátà àbẹ̀wò ṣe máa tọ́jú àwọn àwòrán àti àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ fún ìgbà pípẹ́ tó','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Awọn iṣẹju-aaya. O kan awọn aworan, CSS ati JavaScript nikan — kii ṣe awọn oju-iwe rara. Ṣeto si 0 lati fi eyi silẹ fun olupale rẹ.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Àwọn àlejò tí ó wọlé','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Ma ṣe fi oju-iwe ti a fi pamọ ranṣẹ si alejo ti o wọle rara','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'"Tan-an" ni idáhùn tó láàbò àti ti àkókọ̀gbéka. Pa á nìkan bí o bá mọ̀ pé gbogbo ojú-ewé tí a tọ́jú sínú kásì jẹ́ bákan náà fún olúkúlùkù olùmúlò tí ó wọlé — ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù ọmọ-ẹgbẹ́ ló sábà máa ń jẹ́ ìdí láti má ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Àwọn àkókò ìwàláàyè ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀ fún àwọn àkóónú ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: àwọn ojú-ewé ọjà ti ilé-ìtajà kan fún wákàtí kan, nígbà tí gbogbo nǹkan mìíràn yóò wà fún ọ̀sẹ̀ kan.','Add a rule'=>'Ṣafikun ofin kan','Content type'=>'Irú àkóónú','Seconds'=>'Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú àáyá','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ ohun (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Olùgbàlejò rẹ ń lo àfipamọ́ ohun-ìní Redis aládàáni fún ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, ó sì ń tọ́jú rẹ̀ ní títò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ. Kò sí ohun kankan láti ṣètò níhìn-ín; ipò tí ó wà lókè ojú-iboju yìí ń fi hàn bóyá ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Ó ń tọ́jú àwọn àbájáde ìbéèrè ibùdó-ìpìlẹ̀ data sí cache. Ó ń ṣèrànwọ́ jùlọ lórí ilé-ìtajà tí ó dí púpọ̀ tàbí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù kan tí ó ní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn olùbẹ̀wò tí wọ́n wọlé, níbi tí cache ojú-ewé kò ti lè ṣèrànwọ́.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Fi drop-in ibi-ipamọ nkan Redis sii','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Ó nílò àfikún phpredis. Tí kò bá sí, àpótí tó wà lókè ojú ìbòjú yìí yóò sọ bẹ́ẹ̀.','Redis host'=>'Agbalejo Redis','Redis port'=>'Èbúté Redis','Redis database'=>'Ibùdó dátà Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Fun aaye kọọkan lori Redis ti a pinpin ni nọmba tirẹ, bibẹkọ wọn yoo pa kaṣi ara wọn rẹ.','Redis username'=>'Orukọ olumulo Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Fun olupin Redis pelu awon olumulo ACL nikan (Redis 6 tabi ti o tele). Fi sile ni ofo lati wole pelu oro igbaniwọle nikan.','Redis password'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Fi silẹ ni ofifo ti Redis rẹ ko ba nilo rẹ.','Key prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́wájú kọ́kọ́rọ́','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Yiyan miiran si nọmba ibi-ipamọ data lọtọ nigbati o ko ba le ni ọkan.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Ìparẹ́ aládàáṣiṣẹ́ olóye','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Nu àwọn ojú-ewé tí ọ̀rọ̀ kàn lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ nígbàtí àkóónú bá yípadà','After updates'=>'Lẹ́yìn àwọn àmúdájú','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Pa gbogbo nǹkan rẹ́ lẹ́yìn àmúgbégà kọ́ọ̀, àfikún tàbí àkòrí','After a comment'=>'Lẹ́yìn àròjinlẹ̀','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Nu ojú-ewé àtẹ̀jáde kan nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́sí àwíyé kan lórí rẹ̀','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Pa èyí ní abala àwọn àròsọ tí ó kún fún iṣẹ́ púpọ̀, ní ibi tí ó ti lè nu ojú-ewé kan náà ní ọgọ́rọ̀ọ̀rún ìgbà láàárín wákàtí kan.','Never cache these'=>'Má ṣe fi àwọn wọ̀nyí pamọ́ sí cache rárá','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'A máa ń lo àwọn ìpìlẹ̀ tó bọ́gbọ́nmu ti WordPress àti WooCommerce nígbà gbogbo — a kì í fi cart, checkout, my-account àti ìgbìmọ̀ tí a wọlé sí pamọ́ sínú cache láé, ohun yòówù kó wà nísàlẹ̀.','Addresses'=>'Àwọn àdírẹ́sì','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Oju-ọna kan fun ila kọọkan, fun apẹẹrẹ <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> ti o wa ni ipari ba gbogbo ohun ti o wa labẹ rẹ mu.','Query parameters'=>'Awọn paramita ibeere','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ojú-ìwé tí ó ní ọ̀kan nínú àwọn wọ̀nyí kì í ṣe ìpamọ́ sí káchì rárá — fún àpẹẹrẹ àmì àtúnyẹ̀wò ẹ̀ẹ̀kan ṣoṣo.','Cookies'=>'Kúkì','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Alejo ti o ni ọkan ninu awọn wọnyi ni a ma n fun ni oju-iwe titun nigbagbogbo.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Gbogbo oju-iwe ti a fi pamọ́ ni a ti sọ nù. Wọn yoo tun kọ bi awọn alejo ṣe n de.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'A ti fi kaṣi nkan sii, ṣugbọn kò tọ́jú ohunkóhun.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Àfipamọ́ ojú-ewé wà ní títàn, ṣùgbọ́n a kò tíì tọ́jú àwọn ojú-ewé náà.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress kò tíì gbé drop-in àkójọ-pamọ́ ojú-ewé jáde. Yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá tún gbé ojú-ewé náà jáde nígbà míràn; bí kò bá rí bẹ́ẹ̀, ẹ rí i dájú pé WP_CACHE jẹ́ true nínú wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Ibùfipamọ́ ohun-ìní wà ní tàn, ṣùgbọ́n olupin yìí kò ní àtìlẹ́yìn Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'A ko fi afikun phpredis sii, nitorina a ko le lo drop-in ati pe WordPress n pada si cache iranti tirẹ. Beere lọwọ olupese iṣẹ alejo gbigba rẹ lati mu phpredis ṣiṣẹ.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a ń fi pamọ́ sórí àkópamọ́.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Gbogbo cache mejeeji ni a ti pa, nitorina afikun yi ko mu aaye ayelujara naa yara sii.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Fífipamọ́ sórí àkànpọ̀ n ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis kọ orúkọ olùlò tàbí ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ẹ̀rí Redis nínú wp-config.php tàbí lórí ojú-ìbòjú yìí.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis gba iwọle wọle ṣugbọn ko gba aaye yii laaye lati tọju awọn kọkọrọ rẹ. Olumulo Redis nilo igbanilaaye fun iṣaaju kọkọrọ aaye yii.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis kọ nọ́mbà àkójọ data náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ètò àkójọ data Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis ko ni iranti mo ati pe o n ko data titun.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'A ko fi afikun phpredis sii, nitori naa WordPress n lo kaṣe inu iranti tirẹ. Beere lọwọ olupese alejo gbigba rẹ lati mu phpredis ṣiṣẹ.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'A ṣeto WP_REDIS_DISABLED ninu wp-config.php, nitorinaa a ti pa cache nkan naa.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Kò le dé ibùdó Redis. Yẹ olùgbàlejò àti ibùdókọ̀ Redis wò, kí o sì ríi dájú pé Redis ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis kò da iye tí a ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ kọ sí inú rẹ̀ padà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àkọsílẹ̀ olupin Redis náà.','Web server'=>'Olupin ayelujara','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — aṣàwákiri ayélujára ń fi àwọn ojú-ewé pamọ́ sínú kàṣi','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'Kìí ṣe LiteSpeed — àwọn ojú-ìwé wà ní ìpamọ́ sórí àwo-ìrántí nípasẹ̀ àfikún yìí','Pages stored on disk'=>'Àwọn ojú-ìwé tí a fi pamọ́ sórí àwo','Redis support'=>'Atilẹyin Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'A ti fi phpredis sípò','phpredis is not installed'=>'A kò fi phpredis sórí ẹ̀rọ','Page lifetime'=>'Akoko igbesi aye oju-iwe','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'A ko fun ọ ni aṣẹ lati nu cache rẹ.','Cache purge requested.'=>'A ti beere fun fifọ cache.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: a ti fi drop-in object-cache mìíràn sípò, nítorí náà àfikún yìí kò ṣàkóso cache ohun Redis.','detected'=>'Ti rii','not detected'=>'A kò rí i','phpredis extension missing'=>'Ifaagun phpredis sonu','installed, not storing anything'=>'ti fi sii, ko fi ohunkohun pamọ','active, managed by your host'=>'ṣiṣẹ́, tí a ń bójútó nípasẹ̀ olùgbàlejò rẹ','active'=>'Ṣiṣẹ́','inactive'=>'Àìṣiṣẹ́','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Kaṣi LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Àfipamọ́ nkan Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Afikun Redis PHP (phpredis) kò si lori olupin yii, nitorinaa a ko le mu kaṣe nkan ṣiṣẹ.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'A ti fi drop-in object-cache mìíràn sípò tẹ́lẹ̀. Yọ ọ́ kúrò kí o tó mú cache ohun-ìní Zinn® ṣiṣẹ́.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Kò le kọ faili iṣeto asopọ Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'A kò le ka object-cache drop-in tí a papọ̀ mọ́ ọn.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Kò le fi object-cache drop-in sori wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Kò lè yọ drop-in object-cache kúrò.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Eto faili WordPress ko le ṣe kikọ si, nitori naa a ko le ṣakoso drop-in object-cache.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Àfikún cache ojú-ewé míràn ti fi wp-content/advanced-cache.php sípò. Ẹ kọ́kọ́ yọ àfikún yẹn kúrò ná, tàbí kí ẹ máa bá a lọ láti lo cache ojú-ewé rẹ̀.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'A ko le kọ sinu folda wp-content/cache/zinn-cache, nitorina a ko le fi awọn oju-iwe pamọ si cache.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'A ko le kọ si wp-content/advanced-cache.php, nitori naa a ko le ṣe adamo awọn oju-iwe.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtújáde Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣàfikún ti Zinn® kò pèsè ọ̀nà ìgbàsílẹ̀ fún ìṣàfikún yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè kàn sí pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùnà nínú àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.','Go Pro'=>'Gba Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Oju-iboju atupale kaṣi: ipin kọlu, iranti, awọn bọtini ati awọn aṣẹ kaṣi ti o lọra julọ.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Olùwárí àwọn ìbéèrè tó lọra àti àwọn ìpè tí a kò fi pamọ́ sínú káṣì tí ń dárúkọ àtìlẹ́yìn tàbí àkòrí tó fa èyí.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Ipele APCu ninu-iranti niwaju Redis fun awon kokoro to gbona julo, pelu gbigba-saaju, fisun ati olutontele igbinary.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Ìfọwọ́wẹ́numọ́ tó dá lórí àmì fún àwọn àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àti àwọn ọjà WooCommerce, kí ohun tí ó yípadà nìkan lè di mímú kúrò, pẹ̀lú kásì ojú-ewé àti ti nǹkan tí a fọ̀ mọ́ pa pọ̀.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Ìmúpọ̀ kásì aládàáṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́yìn ìgbálẹ̀, àwòrán WebP àti AVIF, yíyọ CSS tí a kò lò kúrò àti JavaScript tí a sún síwájú.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Ìfọmọ́tótó ibùdó-ìpìlẹ̀ data tí a ṣètò pẹ̀lú àkíyèsí tẹ́lẹ̀, àti àwọn ìlànà cache fún ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Awọn ifitonileti ilera kaṣe ninu dasibodu Zinn Digital® rẹ nigbati ipin ifọwọkan ba lọ silẹ tabi iranti ba kun.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Gbogbo nkan lori awon taabu yoku wa ni ofe, yoo si wa ni ofe bee. Pro n fi sori plug-in yii o si n fi kun:','See what Pro costs'=>'Wo iye tí Pro ń ná','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Ètò kọ̀ọ̀kan bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àkókò ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ ti ọjọ́ 14, kò sí káàdì tí a nílò: %1$s lọ́dún fún ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù kan, %2$s fún ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù márùn-ún, %3$s fún ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tí kò lopin.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'A kò rí wp-config.php, nítorí náà a kò lè tan WP_CACHE. Fi define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); kún un.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php ti ṣalaye WP_CACHE tẹlẹ gẹgẹbi false, nitorinaa kaṣe oju-iwe ko le bẹrẹ. Yi pada si true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'A ko le kọ sinu wp-config.php, nitorina a ko le tan WP_CACHE. Ṣafikun define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); si i.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'A ti fipamọ́. Tẹ iye titun kan lati rọ́pò rẹ̀.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ́ àkójọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣẹ àtòjọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá àlẹ̀ náà mu.','Add a row'=>'Ṣafikun ọ̀wọ́ kan','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ìlà yìí kúrò','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Akopọ','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo ohun-afikun Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò sí àsopọ̀ tí a nílò fún àfikún yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn abala ètò','Support'=>'Ìrànwọ́','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ́ àwọn àyípadà','Tools'=>'Àwọn irinṣẹ́','Export settings'=>'Gbe àwọn ètò jáde','Reset to defaults'=>'Tuntò sí àwọn àkọ́kọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò dá gbogbo ètò lórí àfikún yìí padà sí ti àkọ́kọ́. Ṣe o fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Àyèwò fún àtìlẹ́yìn','Import a settings file'=>'Kó fáìlì ètò wọlé','Import'=>'Kó wọlé','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn faili ti a firanṣẹ sita ko ni awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle, awọn ami tabi awọn bọtini API ninu rara — iwọ yoo nilo lati tun tẹ wọn sii lori aaye tuntun naa.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo eto lori afikun yii ti pada si aiyipada re.','Done.'=>'Ti parí.','That action is not available.'=>'Igbese yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A kò le ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì ètò tí a gbà jáde láti inú àfikún Zinn® kan.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìmúwọlé àwọn ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kì í ṣe ìmújáde àwọn ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A ṣe àgbéwọlé fáìlì yẹn láti inú àfikún mìíràn (%s), nítorí náà kíkó o wọlé síbí yóò fi àwọn ètò tí àfikún yìí kò mọ̀ pamọ́.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'A ti gbe ètò %d wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API kì í sí nínú àkójọ ìgbéjáde rárá, nítorí náà tún wọn tẹ̀ sii.','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Connecting…'=>'Ń sopọ̀…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ti so pọ̀, ṣùgbọ́n nǹkan kan nílò àfiyèsí','Not connected'=>'A kò sopọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Nṣiṣẹ lori akọọlẹ ti ara rẹ','We could not check this'=>'A ko le ṣayẹwo eyi','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Àfikún yìí kò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Ẹ fi ìròyìn ìṣàyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ a ó sì yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò.','Connection status'=>'Ipò ìsopọ̀','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A yẹ ẹ wò kẹ́yìn ní %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ń ṣí sí táàbù tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi èyí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Gangan ohun tí a óò fi ránṣẹ́ nìyí — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun tó farapamọ́. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé, àwọn tókẹ̀nì àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API yín kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ sí pátákó ìpamọ́','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A máa ń ṣí tikẹti ìrànwọ́ fún ọ tí a sì ń fèsì nípasẹ̀ imeeli. Tí o kò bá fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́, ṣe ẹ̀dà rẹ̀ lókè kí o sì lẹ̀ ẹ́ sínú tikẹti fúnra rẹ.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati olupin yii (%s). Da iroyin ti o wa loke kọ ki o si ṣi tikẹti kan dipo — ko si ohun ti o buru ninu awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ẹ̀ka ìrànwọ́ Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn yín, wọn yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ lẹ́tà-ayélujára.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ẹ̀ka ìrànlọ́wọ́ Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ — ìtọ́kasí %s — wọn yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ imeeli.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ẹ ti fi àwọn ìròyìn púpọ̀ ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Ẹ dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tún gbìyànjú — àwọn ti tẹ́lẹ̀ ti dé.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le gba ìròyìn náà wọlé ní báyìí — ìyẹn jẹ́ láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa, kì í ṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ rẹ. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi láìpẹ́, tàbí kí o da ìròyìn tó wà lókè yìí kọ sínú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ ijabọ naa (HTTP %d). Daakọ loke ki o si ṣi tiketi kan, nipa sísọ nọmba yẹn.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Onibara alejo gbigba? Gba ẹdinwo %1$d%% lori %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Gẹ́gẹ́ bí oníbàárà ìgbàlejò Zinn Digital®, o gba kóòdù ti ara ẹni fún %d%% ẹdinwo lórí ìsanwó àkọ́kọ́ rẹ. Àwọn ìmúdàtuntun wà ní iye owó déédéé.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Gba kóòdù %d%% mi ki o si lọ si isanwo','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ẹ má bínú, a kò gbà yín láàyè láti ṣe èyí.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Ẹdinwo yii wa fun awọn onibara ti o ni eto alejo gbigba ti o sanwo ti o si wa ni ipo to dara. Awọn idanwo ọfẹ ko yẹ.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'O ti lo ẹdinwo alabara alejo gbigba rẹ tẹlẹ fun itanna yii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'A ko le gba koodu re ni bayii. Jowo gbiyanju leekansi ni iwon iseju die.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà olùlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi èyí pamọ́','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àwòkọ afẹ́yìntì ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ti a ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ, awọn orukọ ìkànnì ati awọn ibi ifibọ ọna asopọ, pẹlu fifi owo pamọ lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ọ̀nà ìgbésí ayé wọn síṣẹ́','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́ freelance àgbáyé wa: wá nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ tí ó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn òǹkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe àpẹẹrẹ, àwọn olùgbéejáde àti àwọn akọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ kan sílẹ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnadúrà lórí rẹ̀.','Style preset'=>'Ètò àkànṣe ti àṣà','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ojú-ìwé ìbẹ̀rẹ̀. Ohunkóhun tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ ń borí rẹ̀.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo àwọn àwọ̀ àti ìwọ̀n ti èmi fúnra mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi èyí sílẹ̀ ní pípa tì kọ́ńpútà yóò sì lo ètò àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ náà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wà gan-an.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'kóòdù àṣẹ','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'A kò tíì so olùmúlò kan pọ̀ mọ́ ìwé-àṣẹ náà, èyí tí ó ṣe pàtàkì láti dènà ìmúṣiṣẹ́ láìgba àṣẹ. Láti fi ìwé-àṣẹ náà fún olùmúlò rẹ, o gbà láti pín orúkọ kíkún àti àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì olùmúlò WordPress rẹ.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tí a mẹ́nubà lókè yìí','Account'=>'Àkàwún','Account Details'=>'Àwọn Kúlẹ́kúlẹ́ Àkọ́ọ́lẹ̀','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ ń dúró de ìmúṣiṣẹ́. Jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò e-meeli rẹ kí o sì tẹ ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ náà láti mú àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ ṣiṣẹ́, lẹ́yìn náà tún fọ́ọ̀mù alájọṣepọ̀ fi ránṣẹ́.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ṣe iwọ yoo fẹ lati da %1$s pọ mọ %2$s?','Actions'=>'Àwọn ìgbése','Activate'=>'Muuṣiṣẹ','Activate Free Version'=>'Muu Ẹ̀dà Ọ̀fẹ́ Ṣiṣẹ́','Activate License'=>'Muu Iwe-aṣẹ Ṣiṣẹ','activate a license here'=>'Muu iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ nibi','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ kọ́kọ́rọ́ ìwé àṣẹ tí o gbà nínú lẹ́tà kọ̀ǹpútà rẹ lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ lẹ́yìn ríra wọlé:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Muu iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ lori gbogbo awọn aaye ti o wa ninu nẹtiwọọki.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Muu iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ lori gbogbo awọn aaye to wa ni idaduro.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' A ti fi ẹ̀dà sisanwo ti %1$s sori tẹ́lẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ mú un ṣiṣẹ́ láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní jàǹfààní àwọn àbùdá %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' Ẹ̀dà sísanwó ti %1$s ti wà ní fífisípò tẹ́lẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ lọ sí %2$s láti mú un ṣiṣẹ́ kí o sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní jàǹfààní àwọn àbùdá %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Muu afikun yii ṣiṣẹ','Activate %s'=>'Muu %s ṣiṣẹ','Activate %s features'=>'Muu awọn ẹya %s ṣiṣẹ','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Pari Ṣiṣe "%s" Lọwọ Bayi','Activate %s Plan'=>'Muu Ètò %s Ṣiṣẹ́','Activated'=>'Ti ṣiṣẹ','Activating'=>'Ń múu ṣiṣẹ́','Activating license'=>'Ń mú ìwé-àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ́','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'A ti mu akọọlẹ rẹ ṣiṣẹ ni aṣeyọri pẹl