àgbéjáde %1$s tuntun kí o sì ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀ àti ìfisípò wọn pẹ̀lú ọwọ́. Kì í ṣe wàhálà lásán, ṣùgbọ́n pípàdánù ìmúdàgbàsókè kan lè fi ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ sínú ewu kí ó sì fa àwọn ìṣòro àìbáramu tí kò pọndandan, nítorí náà a gbani nímọ̀ràn gidigidi láti jẹ́ kí àwọn àṣẹ pàtàkì wọ̀nyí wà ní títàn.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Fagilee %1$s - Nko nilo aabo & awọn imudojuiwọn ẹya kankan mọ, tabi atilẹyin fun %2$s nitori nko gbero lati lo %3$s lori eyi, tabi aaye miiran.','Cancel %s?'=>'Fagilee %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'N fagilee %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'N fagilee %s...','Click here'=>'Tẹ ibi','Deactivating'=>'Ń mú kúrò ní ìṣẹ́','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Gige asopọ oju opo wẹẹbu yoo yọ %s kuro patapata ninu akọọlẹ Dasibodu Olumulo rẹ.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Fún ìfiranṣẹ́ àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun ààbò & àwọn àbùdá láifọwọ́ṣe, àti ìṣàkóso & ààbò ìwé-àṣẹ, %s nílò láti:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Fún ìfiranṣẹ́ àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun ààbò & àwọn àbùdá, àti ìṣàkóso ìwé-àṣẹ, %s nílò láti','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius jẹ́ ẹ̀rọ ìwé-àṣẹ àti ìròyìn àtúnṣe software wa','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ti eyi ba jẹ ẹda ti o wa fun igba pipẹ, lati tọju awọn imudojuiwọn aifọwọyi ati iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti a sanwo lẹhin %1$s, jọwọ %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ṣe %2$s jẹ ẹda ti %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Darapọ mọ Eto Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Darapọ mọ eto Beta','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','License Key'=>'Kókó Àṣẹ','License key'=>'Kókó àṣẹ','Monthly'=>'Oṣooṣù','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Àwọn orúkọ, àwọn slug, àwọn àtúnṣe, àti bóyá wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́','New Version Available'=>'Ẹ̀yà Tuntun Wà','Optional'=>'Kò pọndandan','Plan'=>'Ètò','Products'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Pipin data iwadii aisan ṣe iranlọwọ lati pese iṣẹ afikun ti o baamu si oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ, yago fun aisi ibaramu ẹya WordPress tabi PHP ti o le ba oju opo wẹẹbu jẹ, ati mọ awọn ede & agbegbe ti o yẹ ki a tumọ %s si ti a si ṣe deede fun.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Kí ẹ le tún ìwé-àṣẹ náà lò nígbà tí %s kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ mọ́.','Subscription'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ́','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s yóò máa fi àwọn dátà àṣẹ pàtàkì ránṣẹ́ sí %2$s lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ìmúdàgbàsókè ààbò àti àwọn àbùdá, àti láti fìdí ìwúlò àṣẹ yín múlẹ̀.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%1$s kan ti %2$s wa.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Lati rii daju ibamu ati yago fun awọn ija pẹlu awọn afikun ati awọn akori ti o fi sori ẹrọ.','Trial'=>'Idanwo','View %s State'=>'Wo Ipò %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Wo Àkójọpọ̀ Ìròyìn Ìpìlẹ̀ %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ni, %2$s jẹ́ àwòkọ ti %4$s fún ète ìdánwò, staging, tàbí ìdàgbàsókè.','You have a %s license.'=>'O ni iwe-aṣẹ %s kan.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'O ti ra iwe-aṣẹ %s kan.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'O yẹ ki o gba imeeli ìmúdájú fun %1$s sinu apoti ifiweranse rẹ ni %2$s. Jọwọ rii daju pe o tẹ bọtini ti o wa ninu imeeli yẹn lati %3$s.','days'=>'àwọn ọjọ́','deactivating'=>'Ń sọ di alaiṣiṣẹ','hour'=>'wákàtí','hours'=>'awọn wakati','license'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','optional'=>'àṣàyàn','products'=>'Àwọn ohun-èlò','skip'=>'Fò fo','subscription'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀','trial'=>'Ìdánwò','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ń mú ṣiṣẹ́','as software licenseLicense'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','close a windowDismiss'=>'Fò kọjá','close windowDismiss'=>'Bojuto','like websitesSites'=>'Àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','nounPricing'=>'Iye owó','trial periodTrial'=>'Àkókò Ìdánwò','verbOpt In'=>'Kópa','verbOpt Out'=>'Yọwọ́ kúrò','verbSkip'=>'Fò','verbUpgrade'=>'Ṣe àgbéga','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s sẹ́yìn','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'A ko le pari igbese naa. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi, ati ti o ba tẹsiwaju lati kuna, kan si alabojuto aaye naa.','Connect an AI app'=>'So ohun elo AI pọ̀','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìsopọ̀ yìí ti parí. Padà sí inú àpù náà kí o sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s n tọrọ lati lo %2$s lori aaye yii bii %3$s. O le ṣe ohun ti a gba akọọlẹ WordPress rẹ laaye lati ṣe nikan, ati pe o le ge asopọ rẹ nigbakugba lati awọn eto awọn aṣoju AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ṣe idanimọ ara rẹ lati %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s forukọsilẹ funrararẹ laifọwọyi. Tẹsiwaju nikan ti o ba bẹrẹ eyi lati %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò le lo àwọn irinṣẹ́ wọ̀nyí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ olùṣàkóso.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Lẹ́yìn tí ẹ bá dáhùn, ẹ ó padà sí %s.','Allow %s'=>'Gba %s láàyè','Do not allow'=>'Maa ṣe gba laaye','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Iye kan ti a beere fun sonu tabi o ni fọọmu ti ko tọ. Ṣayẹwo ilana titẹwọle (input schema) ti agbara naa.','The site refused the request.'=>'Ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà kọ̀ ìbéèrè náà.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Gba awọn oluranlọwọ AI laaye bii Claude, Cursor tabi VS Code lati ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii fun ọ nipasẹ MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wọn wọle bi olumulo WordPress kan (Claude ati ChatGPT nipa fọwọsi wọn nibi, awọn miiran pẹlu ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo) ati pe wọn le ṣe ohun ti olumulo yẹn gba laaye lati ṣe nikan.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Àwọn aṣojú AI nílò WordPress 6.9 tàbí tuntun sí i. Ṣe àfikún sí WordPress láti lò wọ́n.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì ìsopọ̀ (ojú-ìparí MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude àti ChatGPT: wọle dípò','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ṣafikun adirẹsi asopọ naa gẹgẹbi asopọ aṣa ninu Claude, tabi gẹgẹbi ohun elo ninu ipo olupilẹṣẹ ChatGPT. Wọn yoo ṣii aaye yii ki ẹ le fọwọsi wọn; ko si ọrọ igbaniwọle kankan lati daakọ.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Àwọn àpù AI tí a so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọ́ọ́lẹ̀ rẹ:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Awọn ohun elo AI miiran: ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo kan','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ṣẹda ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo fun olumulo rẹ','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ṣafikun eyi si awọn eto MCP ti app AI rẹ, pẹlu orukọ olumulo rẹ ati ọrọ igbaniwọle yẹn:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: fi àkọsílẹ̀ kan náà sí abẹ́ "servers" nínú .vscode/mcp.json, kì í ṣe lábẹ́ "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ ti aṣoju AI le lo nibi (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Itọsọna olumulo: Awọn aṣoju AI ati MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ olùgbédàgbà: àwọn agbára, REST àti MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wò kí o sì palẹ̀ kaṣi ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí mọ́, kí o sì yí àwọn ètò kaṣi rẹ̀ padà pẹ̀lú Zinn® Cache.','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'Ipò cache ojú-ewé àti nǹkan, pípá-rẹ́ àti àwọn ètò.','Read the cache status'=>'Ka ipò kaṣi','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'Ó ń dá a padà bóyá àfipamọ́ ojú-ewé àti àfipamọ́ ohun-ìní wà ní títàn tí wọ́n sì ń ṣiṣẹ́, iye àwọn ojú-ewé tí a fi pamọ́, àti iye ìsopọ̀ pẹ̀lú iye àmúlò ti àfipamọ́ ohun-ìní náà.','Read the cache settings'=>'Ka awọn eto cache','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Ó ń dá gbogbo ètò cache padà. Ọ̀rọ̀-ìwọlé Redis kò ní padà wá rárá, kìkì bóyá a ti fi ọ̀kan pamọ́ ni.','Change the cache settings'=>'Yi awọn eto cache pada','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'Ó ń yí àwọn ètò tí ẹ fi ránṣẹ́ padà tí ó sì ń pa àwọn yòókù mọ́ (cache ojú-ewé, bí àwọn ojú-ewé ṣe ń pẹ́ tó nínú cache, cache ohun-èlò àti ìsopọ̀ Redis rẹ̀, àwọn òfin ìgbálẹ̀ àti àwọn àyàfi). A máa ń yẹ àwọn iye wò tí a sì ń tún wọn ṣe gan-an gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wà lójú ìbòjú Cache.','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'Da awọn eto cache pada si awọn aiyipada wọn','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'O n da gbogbo eto kaṣi pada si aiyipada re, bi botini Tun-eto se n se. A tun yọ ọrọigbaniwọle Redis ti a fipamọ kuro.','Read the diagnostics report'=>'Ka iroyin ayẹwo naa','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'Ó ń da èsì ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò tí ìtìlẹ́yìn béèrè fún padà: àwọn àtúnṣe, àwọn ààlà olupin, ipò cache àti àwọn àṣìṣe àìpẹ́. Kò ní ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà tàbí kókó kankan nínú.','Purge the cache'=>'Nu kaṣi kuro','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Ó ń pa àwọn ojú-ewé tí a fi pamọ́ rẹ́: gbogbo nǹkan (all: true), àwọn àdírẹ́sì kan (urls) tàbí gbogbo nǹkan tí a fún ní àmì (tags). A máa ń tún àwọn ojú-ewé kọ́ bí àwọn àlejò ṣe ń dé.']];